<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Árboles de Decisión y Random Forest: Laboratorio Interactivo</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Chart.js CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        navy: {
                            DEFAULT: '#002060',
                            dark: '#001338',
                            light: '#0a3285'
                        },
                        celeste: {
                            DEFAULT: '#DCE6F2',
                            light: '#F0F4FA',
                            dark: '#B0C4DE'
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        .tooltip-container:hover .tooltip-text {
            visibility: visible;
            opacity: 1;
        }
        /* Custom scrollbar */
        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: #F0F4FA;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #B0C4DE;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
            background: #002060;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-celeste-light text-slate-800 font-sans min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between">

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="bg-navy text-white shadow-md">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4">
            <div>
                <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2">
                    <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-celeste" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"/></svg>
                    Árboles de Decisión y Random Forest
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xs text-celeste mt-1">Laboratorio Didáctico Interactivo para Estudiantes Universitarios</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-navy-light px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-celeste/20 text-xs text-celeste flex items-center gap-2 shadow-inner">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-300 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
                <span><strong>Aviso:</strong> Datos sintéticos con fines didácticos.</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Navigation Tabs -->
        <div class="bg-navy-dark border-t border-celeste/10">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 flex gap-2">
                <button onclick="switchTab(1)" id="tab-btn-1" class="px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-sm transition-colors border-b-4 border-celeste text-white bg-navy flex items-center gap-2">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
                    Pestaña 1: Gini Paso a Paso
                </button>
                <button onclick="switchTab(2)" id="tab-btn-2" class="px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-sm transition-colors border-b-4 border-transparent text-celeste hover:text-white hover:bg-navy/50 flex items-center gap-2">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 1.79 8 4m0 5c0 2.21-3.582 4-8 4s-8-1.79-8-4"/></svg>
                    Pestaña 2: Un Árbol Frente a un Bosque
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Container -->
    <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 flex-grow w-full">

        <!-- ================= PESTAÑA 1 ================= -->
        <div id="tab-content-1" class="space-y-6">
            <!-- Introduction Card -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-celeste">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy">Explorador de Pureza y Criterio Gini</h2>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Analiza el dataset histórico de 14 correos electrónicos para detectar Phishing. Haz clic en las variables para evaluar la ganancia de información.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative tooltip-container cursor-pointer bg-celeste text-navy px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
                        <span>¿Qué es Gini?</span>
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8.228 9c.549-1.165 2.03-2 3.772-2 2.21 0 4 1.343 4 3 0 1.4-1.278 2.575-3.006 2.907-.542.104-.994.54-.994 1.093m0 3h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
                        <div class="tooltip-text invisible opacity-0 transition-opacity absolute z-10 w-72 bg-navy text-white text-xs rounded-lg p-3 shadow-xl right-0 top-full mt-2 pointer-events-none">
                            El Índice de Gini mide la impureza de un nodo (0 = nodo puro con una sola clase, 0.5 = mezcla perfecta 50/50 en clasificación binaria). El árbol elige la variable que minimice el Gini ponderado.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Grid: Table & Variable Analyser -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
                <!-- Dataset Table (5 cols) -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-celeste flex flex-col">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-navy" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M3 14h18m-9-4v8m-7 0h14a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
                            Dataset de Entrenamiento (14 Correos)
                        </h3>
                        <span class="text-xs bg-celeste px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-navy font-semibold">Phishing: 7 Sí / 7 No</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="overflow-x-auto flex-grow max-h-[420px] rounded border border-celeste/50">
                        <table class="w-full text-left text-xs">
                            <thead class="bg-navy text-white sticky top-0">
                                <tr>
                                    <th class="p-2">#</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">Urgencia</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">Remitente</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">Adjunto</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">Enlace</th>
                                    <th class="p-2">Phishing</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody id="dataset-tbody" class="divide-y divide-celeste/30">
                                <!-- Populated by JS -->
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Variable Gini Evaluator (7 cols) -->
                <div class="lg:col-span-7 bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-celeste flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-navy text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-navy" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/></svg>
                                Analizador de División por Variable
                            </h3>
                            <span class="text-xs text-slate-500">Haz clic en un botón para calcular Gini</span>
                        </div>
                        <!-- Variable Select Buttons -->
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2 mb-4" id="variable-buttons">
                            <button onclick="selectVariable('Urgencia')" id="var-btn-Urgencia" class="p-2.5 rounded-lg border-2 border-navy bg-navy text-white text-xs font-bold transition-all shadow-sm">Urgencia</button>
                            <button onclick="selectVariable('Remitente')" id="var-btn-Remitente" class="p-2.5 rounded-lg border-2 border-celeste bg-celeste-light text-navy text-xs font-bold transition-all hover:bg-celeste">Remitente</button>
                            <button onclick="selectVariable('Adjunto')" id="var-btn-Adjunto" class="p-2.5 rounded-lg border-2 border-celeste bg-celeste-light text-navy text-xs font-bold transition-all hover:bg-celeste">Adjunto</button>
                            <button onclick="selectVariable('Enlace_corto')" id="var-btn-Enlace_corto" class="p-2.5 rounded-lg border-2 border-celeste bg-celeste-light text-navy text-xs font-bold transition-all hover:bg-celeste">Enlace_corto</button>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Analysis Details Container -->
                        <div id="variable-analysis-result" class="bg-celeste-light p-4 rounded-xl border border-celeste space-y-3">
                            <!-- Populated dynamically -->
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Interactive Tree Builder Section -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-celeste">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-navy text-base flex items-center gap-2">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-navy" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
                            Constructor Interactivo de Árbol de Decisión
                        </h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">Simula la toma de decisiones sucesivas y observa cómo se generan automáticamente las reglas lógicas (SI... ENTONCES).</p>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="resetTreeBuilder()" class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-300 text-slate-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors">Reiniciar Constructor</button>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                    <!-- Step 1: Root -->
                    <div class="bg-celeste-light p-4 rounded-xl border border-celeste flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy bg-celeste px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Paso 1: Nodo Raíz</span>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm mt-2">¿Cuál variable divide mejor el dataset completo?</h4>
                            <select id="builder-root" onchange="updateTreeBuilder()" class="w-full mt-3 p-2 text-xs bg-white border border-celeste rounded-lg font-semibold text-navy focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-navy">
                                <option value="">-- Seleccionar Variable Raíz --</option>
                                <option value="Urgencia">Urgencia (Gini Ponderado: 0.339)</option>
                                <option value="Remitente">Remitente (Gini Ponderado: 0.357)</option>
                                <option value="Adjunto">Adjunto (Gini Ponderado: 0.471)</option>
                                <option value="Enlace_corto">Enlace_corto (Gini Ponderado: 0.381)</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div id="builder-root-stats" class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-600"></div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Step 2: Branch Condition -->
                    <div class="bg-celeste-light p-4 rounded-xl border border-celeste flex flex-col justify-between opacity-50 pointer-events-none" id="step-2-container">
                        <div>
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy bg-celeste px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Paso 2: Rama Izquierda (Ej. Alta)</span>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-sm mt-2">Profundizar en la rama principal:</h4>
                            <select id="builder-branch-1" onchange="updateTreeBuilder()" class="w-full mt-3 p-2 text-xs bg-white border border-celeste rounded-lg font-semibold text-navy focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-navy">
                                <option value="">-- Siguiente Variable --</option>
                                <option value="Remitente">Si es Urgencia Alta -> Evaluar Remitente</option>
                                <option value="Enlace_corto">Si es Urgencia Alta -> Evaluar Enlace</option>
                                <option value="Adjunto">Si es Urgencia Alta -> Evaluar Adjunto</option>
                                <option value="Leaf">Clasificar directamente (Hoja)</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div id="builder-branch-1-stats" class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-600"></div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Step 3: Result Rules -->
                    <div class="bg-navy text-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-inner flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div>
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-celeste bg-navy-light px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Reglas Lógicas Resultantes</span>
                            <div id="builder-rules" class="mt-3 text-xs space-y-2 font-mono bg-navy-dark p-3 rounded-lg border border-celeste/20 min-h-[100px]">
                                <span class="text-slate-400 italic">Selecciona nodos para construir las reglas SI... ENTONCES...</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mt-3 text-right">
                            <span id="builder-accuracy" class="text-xs bg-celeste text-navy font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Precisión del Árbol: --%</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ================= PESTAÑA 2 ================= -->
        <div id="tab-content-2" class="space-y-6 hidden">
            <!-- Introduction Card & Controls -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-celeste space-y-4">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-center gap-4">
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-navy">Simulador Comparativo: Árbol Único vs. Random Forest</h2>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">Genera 200 casos sintéticos de correos de Phishing con ruido aleatorio y compara el rendimiento (Overfitting vs. Generalización).</p>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="runSimulation()" class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-navy hover:bg-navy-light text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow-md transition-all flex items-center gap-2">
                        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-celeste" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/></svg>
                        Ejecutar Nueva Simulación (N=200)
                    </button>
                </div>

                <!-- Sliders Controls Bar -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-4 border-t border-celeste/50">
                    <!-- Slider Tree Depth -->
                    <div class="bg-celeste-light p-4 rounded-xl border border-celeste relative tooltip-container">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
                            <label for="slider-depth" class="font-bold text-navy text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-navy" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"/></svg>
                                Profundidad Máxima del Árbol (1 - 10)
                            </label>
                            <span id="val-depth" class="bg-navy text-white text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">4</span>
                        </div>
                        <input type="range" id="slider-depth" min="1" max="10" value="4" oninput="document.getElementById('val-depth').innerText=this.value; runSimulation();" class="w-full accent-navy cursor-pointer">
                        <div class="tooltip-text invisible opacity-0 transition-opacity absolute z-10 w-64 bg-navy text-white text-xs rounded-lg p-3 shadow-xl left-4 bottom-full mb-2 pointer-events-none">
                            Controla cuántos niveles de preguntas puede hacer el árbol. Poca profundidad causa subajuste (underfitting); demasiada profundidad memoriza los datos y causa sobreajuste (overfitting).
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Slider Forest Trees -->
                    <div class="bg-celeste-light p-4 rounded-xl border border-celeste relative tooltip-container">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
                            <label for="slider-trees" class="font-bold text-navy text-xs flex items-center gap-1.5">
                                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-navy" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 1.79 8 4m0 5c0 2.21-3.582 4-8 4s-8-1.79-8-4"/></svg>
                                Número de Árboles en el Bosque (1 - 200)
                            </label>
                            <span id="val-trees" class="bg-navy text-white text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full">50</span>
                        </div>
                        <input type="range" id="slider-trees" min="1" max="200" value="50" oninput="document.getElementById('val-trees').innerText=this.value; runSimulation();" class="w-full accent-navy cursor-pointer">
                        <div class="tooltip-text invisible opacity-0 transition-opacity absolute z-10 w-64 bg-navy text-white text-xs rounded-lg p-3 shadow-xl left-4 bottom-full mb-2 pointer-events-none">
                            Define cuántos árboles votarán en conjunto (Ensemble). Más árboles aumentan la robustez y estabilidad general reduciendo la varianza, aunque a partir de cierto punto el beneficio se estabiliza.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Comparison Metrics Side by Side -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <!-- Single Tree Card -->
                <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-celeste flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-celeste/50 mb-4">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-navy text-base flex items-center gap-2">
                                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
                                Árbol de Decisión Individual
                            </h3>
                            <span class="text-xs bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">1 Árbol</span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Metrics Grid -->
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4">
                            <div class="bg-celeste-light p-3 rounded-lg border border-celeste text-center">
                                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 block">Exactitud (Train)</span>
                                <span id="tree-acc-train" class="text-lg font-bold text-navy">--%</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-celeste-light p-3 rounded-lg border border-celeste text-center">
                                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 block">Exactitud (Test)</span>
                                <span id="tree-acc-test" class="text-lg font-bold text-navy">--%</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-celeste-light p-3 rounded-lg border border-celeste text-center">
                                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 block">Recall (Sensibilidad)</span>
                                <span id="tree-recall" class="text-sm font-bold text-navy">--%</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-celeste-light p-3 rounded-lg border border-celeste text-center">
                                <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 block">F1-Score</span>
                                <span id="tree-f1" class="text-sm font-bold text-navy">--</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Confusion Matrix Display -->
                        <div class="bg-celeste-light p-3 rounded-lg border border-celeste">
                            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-navy block mb-2 text-center">Matriz de Confusión (Prueba)</span>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1 text-center text-xs">
                                <div class="bg-slate-200 p-1 font-semibold text-[10px]">Pred / Real</div>
                                <div class="bg-slate-200 p-1 font-semibold text-[10px]">Phishing (Sí)</div>
                                <div class="bg-slate-200 p-1 font-semibold text-[10px]">Legítimo (No)</div>
                                <div class="bg-slate-200 p-1 font-semibold text-[10px]">Phishing (Sí)</div>
                                <div id="tree-cm-tp" class="bg-white p-2 font-bold text-emerald-700">VP: --</div>
                                <div id="tree-cm-fp" class="bg-white p-2 font-bold text-rose-700">FP: --</div>
                                <div class="bg-slate-200 p-1 font-semibold text-[10px]">Legítimo (No)</div>
                                <div id="tree-cm-fn" class="bg-white p-2 font-bold text-rose-700">FN: --</div>
                                <div id="tree-cm-tn" class="bg-white p-2 font-bold text-emerald-700">VN: --</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Random Forest Card -->
                <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-celeste flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-3 border-b border-celeste/50 mb-4">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-navy text-base flex items-center gap-2">
                                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
                                Random Forest (Bosque Aleatorio)
                            </h3>
                            <span class="text-xs bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full">Ensemble</span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Metrics Grid -->
